This is author self-check, not independent review. No production parser/lower/HTML/browser run was performed by this author. The content records the root's newly specified test scope; it does not independently certify that implementation or its CI result. Draft synchronization does not change the canonical document source. Huygens/root will independently review and execute the appropriate checks.
